==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|bisem}}, from {{inh|de|goh|[[bisam]], [[bisamo]]}}, borrowed from {{der|de|ML.|bisamum}}, from {{der|de|he|בושם|tr=bāśām, bōśem|בֹּשֶׂם|perfume}}.<ref>{{R:Duden}}</ref><ref>Friedrich Kluge (1975), ''Etymologisches Wörterbuch der deutschen Sprache'', Berlin: Walter de Gruyter, p.&nbsp;79.</ref> {{doublet|de|Balsam|t1=[[balm]], [[balsam]]|Desman}}.

